    "detailed_description": "Get ready for an exhilarating adventure in the world of pirates with our new 3D fighting game &quot;Scallywag's Revenge&quot;! <br />\r\nYou are a bold pirate embarking on a dangerous journey filled with intrigue and brutal battles. <br />\r\nEach level is a unique challenge where you must fight against other ruthless pirates to achieve your revenge!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEngage with a diverse array of enemies, each possessing their own unique abilities. <br />\r\nBecome a true master of parrying and counterattacks to gain the upper hand in every duel! <br />\r\nUse your agility and skill to overcome all obstacles in your path.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnique enemies<br />\r\nMastery of parrying<br />\r\nAdrenaline-fueled adventure<br />\r\n3D graphics",
